  "description": "Crew Dart24\nThe Crew Dart V3 24\" takes the proven V2.1 platform and turns it all the way up. Stronger frame. Smoother ride. Smarter design. Every detail has been refined to make this the most dialed Dart yet. With a top speed of 28mph and a range of up to 20 miles on throttle, or up to 40 miles depending on PAS mode and terrain, it’s built to go hard and keep rolling.\nThe Dart V3’s upgraded chromoly steel frame delivers more strength, durability, and a responsive feel, with refined geometry that keeps you stable and in control. A new bench-style saddle improves balance and comfort for longer rides, with grippy materials that keep you locked in.\nA 750w rear hub motor and 48v / 14Ah battery provide quick acceleration and reliable range for everyday riding or weekend sessions. Hydraulic disc brakes and Crew Takeover Tires round it out with confident stopping power and serious street grip. Recommended for riders 5'3\" - 6'1\".",
